---
source: tests/help.rs
expression: help(&path)
---
Remove kept host-mount directories and their contents

Usage: bento kit mounts rm [OPTIONS] <IDS>...

Arguments:
  <IDS>...
          IDs, as `kit mounts ls` shows them

Options:
  -D, --debug
          Print each smolvm command line

      --no-input
          Never prompt; commands that need an answer fail with the command to run instead

  -h, --help
          Print help
